# Servais
tags: heroes, benchmark
stimulus: A long run, eight rounds of bodyweight work, then two heavy carries.
note: The sandbag is heavy, with no fixed load. The original posting gives men's loads only; the women's loads are the commonly used ones.
For time
  1.5 mi Run
  8 rounds
    19 Pull-up
    19 Push-up
    19 Burpee
  400 m Sandbag carry
  1 mi Farmer carry 45/35 lb
